      This runtime is headless: do not call
      ask_user_question. When a genuinely user-owned decision blocks progress,
      explain the decision and available options in your final response.

- insert:
    # DSH's launcher treats this reserved row id as a one-shot surface. The
    # bridge owns process lifetime through appExit, so profile HMR/watchers
    # must never race its shutdown after a result is emitted.
    - id: headless-runner
      name: '@multica-ai/dsh-runtime'
